==============================================================================
A3. Coding claim: pigeonhole, entropy invariance under reordering, double counting
==============================================================================
strings of length < L (including the empty string) = sum_{k<L} 2^k = 2^L - 1: checked L in {1,2,3,4,8,16,32,64}
non-uniform source on 2^12 streams: H(X) = 11.087701347, H(reordered) = 11.087701347, |diff| = 0.00e+00
chain rule: H(suffix) + H(prefix|suffix) = 3.994218444 + 7.093482903 = 11.087701347
=> a suffix lookahead permutes the coordinates; the source entropy is unchanged (PROVED: bijection invariance).

